2026-11-09T11:31:28.167894+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.apollo.bob-cli-ix.1--plan","local_name":"bob-cli-ix.1--plan","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-ix","agent_clan_generation":"20261109052520","agent_session":"bob-cli-ix.1","agent_session_role":"plan","bead_id":"bob-cli-ix.1","changespec_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","cl_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-ix[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Nx: close the running Pomodoro at a stated size[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]Typing `2x!2` closes the running Pomodoro at exactly 2 five-minute [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]blocks from its start (or refuses with a named fix), with honest [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]clocks, one card, additive JSON, documented grammar, a decision [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]record, and a Bob Mac Capture card that shows the size.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]sized_pomodoro_close.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/sized_pomodoro_close.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-ix[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-ix/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Claim `Nx` in both parsers[/bold #D7AFFF]                                    [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]grammar[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]grammar: add the shared size lexer and `PomodoroCloseSpec.size`, claim [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]sized whole-item, chain, and link closes plus their teaching errors in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the execution and editor parsers, extend `capture-parse` spans/JSON and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the close-outcome aliases, and make `bob capture` refuse sized specs [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]until execution lands.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Run sized closes with exact-or-refuse[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold white on #D75F87] large  [/bold white on #D75F87]\n    [#AF87FF]execute[dim] · [dim][/dim]after grammar[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]execute: stage exactly 5N minutes from the session start, close at C = [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]min(S + 5N, now) through all three close entry points, refuse with coded[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]two-line errors, add `pomodoro_close.size` JSON, the sized human caption[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]and `tip:`, and bump the grammar revision to 20.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Document `Nx` and record the decision[/bold #D7AFFF]                         [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]docs[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]docs: update capture.md, the capture-syntax reference, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]capture/capture-parse help, regenerate CLI docs, and add the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]exact-or-refuse decision record when its decision is on.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Present sized closes in Bob Mac Capture[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]mac[dim] · [dim][/dim]after execute[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]mac: decode `size`, draw both-direction arrows and the `Nx · as of [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]HH:MM` chip, widen the close-alias prefilter for digit prefixes, record [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]fixtures from a real bob, and watch macOS CI to green.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-ix","llm_provider":"codex","model":"gpt-6-astra","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-ix.1","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","